                                "sense_id": "a3e96596-994d-321b-88bf-75a567d05c69",
                                "text": "The approach taken in this study was to compare the risk management costs of wheat to that of two non-cwb-marketed Canadian grains: flax and canola."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c077e62-8f49-4319-ab0e-b2a3a6099b24",
                                "sense_id": "a3e96596-994d-321b-88bf-75a567d05c69",
                                "text": "The carbohydrate component of canola meal accounts for about one third of the meal . . ."
                            },
